    <string name="transfer_quick_note">FOLD hands the file to Android\'s share sheet with the right MIME type, so apps that reject unknown files still accept it.</string>
    <!--
      The honest sentence about Quick Share. There is no public API to invoke it
      directly, and hardcoding its component name breaks between releases. Saying
      so once is better than implying an integration that does not exist.
    -->
    <string name="transfer_quick_limitation">Android has no public way for an app to open Quick Share directly, so FOLD opens the system share sheet — Quick Share appears there alongside everything else.</string>
